WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:02.160
Come with me to reinforce the west

00:02.240 --> 00:03.520
To prevent anyone from taking advantage

00:03.680 --> 00:04.800
And coordinating with the Wuzhao

00:04.880 --> 00:05.680
To seize the gates

00:05.800 --> 00:07.200
I accept the order

00:26.600 --> 00:27.880
Brother-in-law, hurry

00:27.960 --> 00:29.160
The south grain depot is on fire

00:29.240 --> 00:30.440
Yiyang can't be held

00:30.520 --> 00:31.360
Shut up

00:31.480 --> 00:32.400
They're going to run

00:32.520 --> 00:33.840
Even Prince of Jin is running

00:34.000 --> 00:35.160
The Wuzhao are coming

00:35.240 --> 00:36.440
Retreat quickly

00:36.520 --> 00:37.040
Stop

00:37.120 --> 00:38.280
Hurry

00:38.360 --> 00:39.760
Stop

00:40.000 --> 00:41.120
Stop

